RedMushling.DisplayName: Red Mushling

MushroomHeir: {
	DisplayName: Mushroom Heir

	TownNPCMood: {
		Content: I feel pretty funky right now.
		NoHome: Bro, do you have a couch I can chill on?
		FarFromHome: Uh, the trip got me pretty far away.
		LoveSpace: Less people around means less people asking about weird substances.
		DislikeCrowded: I have noticed people staring at me, it's bothering me. I'd like less people around.
		HateCrowded: So many people keep asking me about my "stuff", I want to go elsewhere.
		LoveBiome: Maybe if I stay here, I can see my uncle again!
		LikeBiome: This magical place is pretty cool, maybe I find some mystical mushrooms here.
		DislikeBiome: This place is boring as heck.
		HateBiome: I don't want to be here, get me out of here. This just reminds me too much of my old man.
		LoveNPC: Oh {NPCName} is so awesome, she throws the most coolio parties ever. I mean the secret VIP ones, not this boring Happy Birthday crap.
		LikeNPC: It's cool to have another mushroom around, {NPCName} is really chill too.
		DislikeNPC: I sometimes hear {NPCName} breathing behind my door at night... he is creepy...
		HateNPC: DUDE! Why is dad here?! This place SUCKS!
		LikeNPC_Princess: For some weird reason my brain wants to like {NPCName}, but I don't want to.
		Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} is such a funny little goober, I want to just squeeze him!"
	}

	MiscText: {
		FirstTalk1: I am?
		FirstTalk2: Understood
		GiveReality: Give the weird mushroom
		GiveMadness: Give Madness Mushroom
		GiveHover: Give Hovercaps
		GiveRare: Give Rare Plant
	}
}

