FeudalFungus: {
	DisplayName: Feudal Fungus
	SecondPhaseName: Umos
	Spawn1: Rethem?
	Spawn2: Arkem mi ki?
	Spawn3: ...
	Spawn4: Teht ruth...
	Spawn5: Wat her ju dom geru das..?
	Spawn6: WAT HER JU DOMATU!?
	SpawnTranslated1: Brother?
	SpawnTranslated2: What is it?
	SpawnTranslated3: That ring...
	SpawnTranslated4: What have you done to him..?
	SpawnTranslated5: WHAT HAVE YOU DONE!?
	DefeatSpawn: So we meet again wretch.
	Transition1: Terl me, wat her ju domatu!
	Transition2: Focus now!
	Transition3: Teht ordiko essebri me dam rethem's ruth!
	Transition4: Do not be afraid, thy vengeance will come soon.
	Transition5: Listen careful, murderous wretch, thy actions shall be punished.
	Transition6: By the light of Umos!
	Transition7: Bew ta loma mi Umos!
	TransitionTranslated2: This fiend possesses my dear brother's ring!
	Defeat1: Away!
	Defeat2: Away with thee!
	Defeat3: Why art thou not giving up?

	BossChecklistIntegration: {
		SpawnInfo: Use a [i:MultidimensionMod/ConfusingMushroom] in a Glowing Mushroom cave. Obtained by giving 5 [i:MultidimensionMod/HovercapItem] to the Mushroom Heir.
		DespawnMessage: Feudal Fungus disappears into the glowing caverns.
	}
}

