MushroomFollower: {
	DisplayName: Mushroom Follower
	Dialogue1: Ooo light, please let me witness your brilliance, am I not worthy?
	Dialogue2: I'm but a mere shadow in your presence, oh magnificent light!
	Dialogue3: I pray for our continued safety, for a world without crime.
	Dialogue4: There are many creatures that break into our sanctuary, but luckily, our light keeps us safe.
	Dialogue5: The sleeping light, we defend with all our might. The sleeping light, we defend with all our might.
	Dialogue6: Are you a new member of our group?
}

MushroomPreacher: {
	DisplayName: Mushroom Preacher
	Dialogue1: Greetings traveler, what brings you to our beloved sanctuary? Why not come pray with us, you won't regret it.
	Dialogue2: Aaa, aren't the glowing caverns just magnificent this time around?
	Dialogue3: My dear, spread the word of light around, more need to bathe in its glory!
	Dialogue4: Are you here to see him too? Our glowing royalty. If so, let me teach you the words of light.
	Dialogue5: The sleeping light, we defend with all our might. Now my fellows, say it with me! The sleeping light, we defend with all our might.
	Dialogue6: From the darkness, there emerged a spark of light. Soon it created the world, filled it with beings it calls its children. This is us, we who follow its radiance, we who dwell in its warmth.
	Dialogue7: Even with its height... of power, our beloved light, it was feeling bereft, of its primordial might. With a deep breath, it called forth its 3 most beloved children, tasking them to serve the world and watch over us.
}

